Third-party code
================

The TikTok patches and their extensions (`app.czyeru.patches.tiktok`, `app.czyeru.extension.tiktok`,
`app.czyeru.extension.shared`) are derived from icysymmetra/tiktok-patches-for-morphe
(https://github.com/icysymmetra/tiktok-patches-for-morphe), which itself builds on the ReVanced and
Morphe patch sources. The original copyright headers are kept in the individual files. The code is
distributed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see LICENSE).

Patches ported from Hushfeed (https://github.com/SysAdminDoc/hushfeed): Keep the Favorites tab,
Show exact counts, Expand activity list, Copy bio and IDs, Block author button, Not interested
button, Double-tap controls and Comment tools, with the code they need. Hushfeed also builds on
icysymmetra/tiktok-patches-for-morphe and is GPL-3.0. Its copyright headers are kept in the
ported files.
